#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:114
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GTK+ 3"
msgstr "Instalação do GTK+ 3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:117
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GTK+ 3</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>GTK+ 3</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:121
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"            -Dman=true              \\\n"
"            -Dbroadway_backend=true \\\n"
"            ..                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr           \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release     \\\n"
"            -Dman=true              \\\n"
"            -Dbroadway_backend=true \\\n"
"            ..                      &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:131
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"To test the results you need a graphical session, then issue <command>dbus-"
"run-session ninja test</command>."
msgstr ""
"Para testar os resultados você precisa de uma sessão gráfica e, em seguida, "
"emitir <command>dbus-run-session ninja test</command>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:136
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:139
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:142
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"One test named <filename>check-cursor-names</filename> is known to fail if "
"<xref linkend='adwaita-icon-theme'/> is not installed."
msgstr ""
"Um teste chamado <filename>check-cursor-names</filename> é conhecido por "
"falhar se <xref linkend='adwaita-icon-theme'/> não estiver instalado."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:148
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you installed the package on to your system using a "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote> method, an important file was not installed and must "
"be copied and/or generated. Generate it using the following command as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Se você instalou o pacote em teu sistema usando o método "
"<quote>DESTDIR</quote>, [então] um arquivo importante não foi instalado e "
"precisa ser copiado e (ou) gerado. Gere-o usando o seguinte comando como "
"o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><note><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:154
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-3.0 --update-cache</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>gtk-query-immodules-3.0 --update-cache</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:162
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dbroadway_backend=true</parameter>: This switch enables the "
"HTML5 GTK backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dbroadway_backend=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"estrutura &quot;HTML5&quot; de retaguarda do &quot;GTK&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:170
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-Dman=true</parameter>: This switch allows generating manual "
"pages."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-Dman=true</parameter>: Essa chave permite gerar páginas de "
"manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:175
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dgtk_doc=true</option>: This switch enables building documentation."
" It requires <xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dgtk_doc=true</option>: Essa chave habilita construir a "
"documentação. Ela exige o &quot;<xref linkend=\"gtk-doc\"/>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:180
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dtracker3=true</option>: This switch enables the search function "
"based on Tracker 3 in the GTK+-3 file chooser dialog.  It requires <xref "
"linkend=\"tracker3\"/>."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dtracker3=true</option>: Essa chave habilita a função de pesquisa "
"baseada no &quot;Tracker 3&quot; na caixa de diálogo do seletor de arquivos "
"do &quot;GTK+-3&quot;. Ela exige o &quot;<xref linkend=\"tracker3\"/>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:186
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-Dcloudproviders=true</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to enable "
"support for cloud providers in a file chooser window."
msgstr ""
"<option>-Dcloudproviders=true</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver <xref "
"linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar habilitar"
" o suporte para provedores de nuvem em uma janela de seletor de arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:194
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring GTK+ 3"
msgstr "Configurando o GTK+ 3"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid "Config Files"
msgstr "Arquivos de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:199
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename> and "
"<filename>/etc/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename>"
msgstr ""
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename> e "
"<filename>/etc/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:204
#, xml-text
msgid "~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini"
msgstr "~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><indexterm><primary>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:208
#, xml-text
msgid "/etc/gtk-3.0/settings.ini"
msgstr "/etc/gtk-3.0/settings.ini"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:212
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuration Information"
msgstr "Informação de Configuração"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<application>GTK+ 3</application> themes change the way a <application>GTK+ "
"3</application> application looks. An icon theme can be used to change the "
"icons that appear on the application's toolbar.  If you have installed a "
"<application>GTK+ 3</application> theme (e.g.  the Adwaita theme built in "
"<application>GTK+ 3</application>), an icon theme (such as <xref "
"linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>) and/or a font (<xref linkend=\"dejavu-"
"fonts\"/>), you can set your preferences in "
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename>, or the default system "
"wide configuration file (as the <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user), in "
"<filename>/etc/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename>.  For the local user an "
"example is:"
msgstr ""
"Temas do <application>GTK+ 3</application> mudam a maneira como um "
"aplicativo <application>GTK+ 3</application> aparenta. Um tema de ícones "
"pode ser usado para mudar os ícones que aparecem na barra de ferramentas do "
"aplicativo. Se tiver instalado um tema do <application>GTK+ 3</application> "
"(por exemplo, o tema Adwaita construído no <application>GTK+ "
"3</application>), um tema de ícones (como <xref linkend=\"oxygen-icons\"/>) "
"e (ou) uma fonte (<xref linkend=\"dejavu-fonts\"/>), você consegue "
"configurar tuas preferências em "
"<filename>~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename> ou no arquivo padrão de "
"configuração abrangente ao sistema (como o(a) usuário(a) <systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>), em "
"<filename>/etc/gtk-3.0/settings.ini</filename>. Para o(a) usuário(a) local, "
"um exemplo é:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:229
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir -vp ~/.config/gtk-3.0\n"
"cat &gt; ~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Settings]\n"
"gtk-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = <replaceable>oxygen</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-font-name = <replaceable>DejaVu Sans 12</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-size = <replaceable>18</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-toolbar-style = <replaceable>GTK_TOOLBAR_BOTH_HORIZ</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-antialias = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hinting = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hintstyle = <replaceable>hintslight</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-rgba = <replaceable>rgb</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir -vp ~/.config/gtk-3.0\n"
"cat &gt; ~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>[Settings]\n"
"gtk-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-icon-theme-name = <replaceable>oxygen</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-font-name = <replaceable>DejaVu Sans 12</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-size = <replaceable>18</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-toolbar-style = <replaceable>GTK_TOOLBAR_BOTH_HORIZ</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-antialias = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hinting = <replaceable>1</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-hintstyle = <replaceable>hintslight</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-xft-rgba = <replaceable>rgb</replaceable>\n"
"gtk-cursor-theme-name = <replaceable>Adwaita</replaceable></literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"There are many settings keys, some with default values. You can find them at"
" <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gnome.org/gtk3/stable/GtkSettings.html\">Settings: "
"GTK+ 3 Reference Manual</ulink>. There are many more themes available at "
"<ulink url=\"https://www.gnome-look.org/browse/\"/> and other places."
msgstr ""
"Existem muitas chaves de configuração, algumas com valores padrão. Você pode"
" encontrá-las em <ulink "
"url=\"https://developer.gnome.org/gtk3/stable/GtkSettings.html\">Configurações:"
" Manual de referência do GTK+ 3</ulink>. Existem muitos mais temas "
"disponíveis em <ulink url=\"https://www.gnome-look.org/browse/\"/> e em "
"outros lugares."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"As part of GTK+-3.0's redesign, the scroll bar buttons are no longer visible"
" on the scrollbar in many applications. If this functionality is desired, "
"modify the <filename>gtk.css</filename> file and restore them using the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""
"Como parte do reprojeto do &quot;GTK+-3.0&quot;, os botões da barra de "
"rolagem não mais estão visíveis na barra de rolagem em muitos aplicativos. "
"Se essa funcionalidade for desejada, [então] modifique o arquivo "
"&quot;<filename>gtk.css</filename>&quot; e restaure-os usando o seguinte "
"comando:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><sect3><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk+3.xml:259
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.config/gtk-3.0/gtk.css &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>*  {\n"
"   -GtkScrollbar-has-backward-stepper: 1;\n"
"   -GtkScrollbar-has-forward-stepper: 1;\n"
"}</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>cat &gt; ~/.config/gtk-3.0/gtk.css &lt;&lt; \"EOF\"\n"
"<literal>*  {\n"
"   -GtkScrollbar-has-backward-stepper: 1;\n"
"   -GtkScrollbar-has-forward-stepper: 1;\n"
"}</literal>\n"
"EOF</userinput>"

